# a snapshot or a sensor sidecar into the distribution root when a fixture or a
# manual guard invocation points them here. Nothing consumed them, but a broad
# `git add -A` committed one in v0.126.0 -- the same way the budget validator's
# scan channels used to get committed before they moved to mktemp.
